      143.23,
      276.43,
      455.25,
      304.7
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 12 of the People\u2019s Bank Act, No. 29 of 1961(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) by increasing the authorised capital ofthe Bank.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
