    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PEOPLE'S BANK ACT, NO. 29 OF 1961",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      253.73,
      401.89,
      277.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      291.53,
      401.85,
      315.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the People's Bank(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      329.33,
      401.92,
      365.87
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 12 of the People's Bank Act, No. 29 of 1961(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyrepealed and the following section substituted therefor:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      379.73,
      401.87,
      416.27
    ],
    "text": "12. (1) The authorized capital of the Bankshall be rupees fifty billion divided into onebillion shares of rupees fifty each.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      430.13,
      401.88,
      491.87
    ],
    "text": "(2) (a) The Minister may, in the interest ofthe national economy, where he deems itnecessary, determine from time to time the paid-up capital of the Bank, by Order published inthe Gezette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      505.73,
      401.87,
      542.27
    ],
    "text": "(b) Every Order made by the Minister,shall be brought before Parliament forapproval.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      556.13,
      401.88,
      580.07
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 20 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      593.93,
      401.89,
      668.27
    ],
    "text": "20. (1) The Bank may, in addition to thesums lent by the Government to the Bank undersection 15(1)(b) for the purpose of grantinglong term or medium term loans, raise with theapproval of the Minister any sums by the issueof debentures.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      293.71,
      446.13,
      302.78
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
